    "迭代状态属于项目状态推进层，放在 arckit/project/iterations/。",
    "case 是状态变化的证据和过程记录，不替代全局状态或迭代状态。",
    "Project 与 Iteration canonical state 不保存 next responsibility、trigger mode、continuation prompt、Worker 顺序或 round goal。",
